T 5 | Chef Grual in the tavern
A 93 | Chef Grual
C 93 | 6 Gooey Spider Legs. You should have them from the spiders on the south road; if not, more spiders sit beside the road west of town.
T 93 | Chef Grual
A 240 | Chef Grual. The crab cakes go back to Jitters in segment 10.
T 265 | Clerk Daltry in the town hall
A 266 | Clerk Daltry
T 266 | Tavernkeep Smitts in the tavern
