# ---------- Blind Mary and the Insane Ghoul ----------
T 149 | Blind Mary, in the house south of town
A 154 | Blind Mary
C 177 | Press Skip if you never had a Bronze Tube. The Insane Ghoul (26) stands in the chapel of Tranquil Gardens Cemetery (80.9, 72.0). Kill the skeletons near the chapel first so the fight stays one on one. He is four levels above you and your shocks will often be resisted: start at full health and mana, Stoneclaw Totem at once, Earth Shock when ready, Healing Wave before you drop below half. He drops Mary's Looking Glass.
T 154 | Back in Darkshire: Madame Eva
A 157 | Madame Eva. The thread goes to Abercrombie in segment 10.
T 177 | Viktori Prism'Antras
A 181 | Viktori Prism'Antras. The ogre Zzarc'Vul is level 33: kept for segment 10.
A 66 | Madame Eva: The Legend of Stalvan (needs level 22)
T 66 | Clerk Daltry in the town hall
A 67 | Clerk Daltry. It sends you to Moonbrook in Westfall: kept for segment 10.
H Thelsamar | Hearthstone to Thelsamar. Next stop: the Wetlands.
